# --- Local access sheet ------------------------------------------------------
# Live demo URLs and account passwords, kept on this machine only.
DEMO-ACCESS.md

# --- Explicit exceptions -----------------------------------------------------
# Last match wins in gitignore, so every negation must come AFTER the rule it
# undoes. A stray `.env*` used to sit below these and silently disabled both.
# .env.example documents the variables; .env.test holds only local test-database
# settings and a dummy secret. Neither has ever contained a real credential.
!.env.example
!*.env.example
!.env.test
